    "_note": "After batch 1+2 (2026-07-09): comparison boards are the only weight source and are organized by our categories. These in-scope Quechua/Forclaz/Simond families are in the UK feed IN STOCK but still weightless — target boards for the next store trip. Codes may drift NL<->UK (join handles it). Skip out-of-scope: ski/snow/kids boots, climbing shoes, car-camping/rooftop tents, camp furniture, pumps/valves, flasks/mugs/food storage.",
    "footwear_BIGGEST_GAP": "Only the trekking(men) + walking(men/women) boards were shot. ~70 more adult models: MH100/MH500 mountain-hiking boots & shoes (men+women, waterproof, low+mid), MT100/MT500 leather trekking boots (women's + high-cut), NH500/NH900 leather boots, Approach shoes (Rock), MH500 Light, fast-hiking shoes. Find the 'bergwandelschoenen' (mountain) and any women's trekking boards.",
    "cooking_cookware": "Stove board only had burners. Missing the cookware/cookset board: MT500 cookset 1P/2P, pots, cups, sporks (the ones with real weights).",
    "tents_extra": "MT900 4P tunnel (8666970), MT900 UL 3P tunnel (feed 8586319), Makalu mountaineering tents (T2/T3 + Alpine Makalu 2P). MH100 camping tents only if car-camping in scope.",
