    "backpacks_extra": "MT100 Easyfit 70L men / 60L women, MT900 Symbium 70+10 & 90+10 & women's 60+10, Makalu mountaineering 45/70, Arpenaz insulated 25L (several were on boards but under drifted codes)."
  },
